al estate leasing services. The company was formerly known as Ogori Shoji Co., Ltd. and changed its name to Fast Retailing Co., Ltd. in September 1991. The company was founded in 1949 and is headquartered in Yamaguchi, Japan.","fullTimeEmployees":null,"city":"Yamaguchi","country":"Japan","website":"https://www.fastretailing.com","industry":"Apparel Retail","sector":"Consumer Cyclical"},"news":[],"info_date":"2026-10-23"}